SUMMARY: New Music for Old Hands Concert Series: Martin van de Ven
DESCRIPTION:Matinee concert series at Labdara Lithuanian Nursing Home. Ea
 ch concert in this series will premiere a composition performed by the La
 bdara bell choir and Laura Gillis (conductor/pianist). Each composer will
  give a talk and share music with the residents and audience members\, fo
 llowed by a casual social mixer.\n\n2:00pm start time. Free Admission. Re
 serve your spot at Eventbrite. Limited seating available.\n\nJune 20: Mar
 tin van de Ven\n\nComposer Martin van de Ven will bring his clarinet\, wi
 ll share about Klezmer music\, and will share some pieces from the genre\
 , such as Araber Tanz\, and Nokh A Glezyl Vayn. The Labdara bell choir an
 d Laura Gillis (conductor/pianist) will premiere Martin's piece\, Mellow 
 Bells.\n\nwww.facebook.com/NewMusicForOldHands http://www.facebook.com/Ne
 wMusicForOldHands
