SUMMARY: The Riverdale Arts Market Patio Pop Up
DESCRIPTION:The Riverdale Arts Market is part of the newly launched Duke 
 Art Bar Revitalization Project\, an initiative aimed at bringing fresh cr
 eative energy back into one of Queen East’s historic gathering spaces thr
 ough art\, community\, and culture-driven events.\n\nOur goal is to creat
 e a welcoming space where neighbours\, artists\, creatives\, and visitors
  can gather\, discover local talent\, and enjoy a unique kind of summer e
 xperience in the city.\n\nWhether you come to shop\, hang out on the pati
 o\, meet local artists\, enjoy a cocktail\, or simply soak in the atmosph
 ere...we’d love to welcome you.\n\nThis summer launch event will feature:
 \nLocal artisans & makers\nLive Art\nPatio BBQ specials\nCommunity-inspir
 ed summer drink features\nLive creative atmosphere & mural photo-op wall\
 nHandmade goods & unique finds\nA vibrant Queen Street East patio experie
 nce\nCome and help us kick off a new creative tradition in the neighbourh
 ood.\n\nFree to People & Pets
