SUMMARY: My Manifested Life Book Launch by Kathleen Cameron
DESCRIPTION:Manifestation expert Kathleen Cameron is launching her transf
 ormative new book\, My Manifested Life\, and guests are invited to celebr
 ate with women from all walks of life who've stepped into their power.\n\
 nMy Manifested Life tells the stories of women who stopped living as who 
 they'd been and took that leap of faith into who they're becoming. These 
 are real transformations. New jobs. New relationships. New identities. No
 t because it was easy\, but because they were willing to grow and commit 
 to their dreams.\n\nJoin Kathleen Cameron for an inspiring evening filled
  with meaningful conversations\, networking\, and photo opportunities. Gu
 ests will receive their own copy of the book\, enjoy light snacks and dri
 nks\, and connect with an amazing community of women redefining success.
