SUMMARY: Killer B Cinema Presents: Banglar Superman!
DESCRIPTION:It’s a bird! It’s a plane! It’s Banglar Superman! Join us on 
 July 3rd for a Superman you’ve never seen before! Oh\, and there is danci
 ng!\n\n\nAdvanced tickets are $5\; tickets at the door are $8 (Space is l
 imited\, and tickets sell out fast)!\n\n\nTicket Link: https://www.eventb
 rite.ca/e/1991276454479?aff=oddtdtcreator https://www.eventbrite.ca/e/199
 1276454479?aff=oddtdtcreator\n\n\nDoors open at 7:30 pm\, and the movie b
 egins at 8:00.\n\n\n*NO outside food or drinks\; please buy food and drin
 ks from the venue.\n\n\n*All films have closed captioning.\n\n\nMovie inf
 o:\n\nIn this gloriously unauthorized Bangladeshi superhero spectacular\,
  young Robin is blasted to Earth just before General Zod\, Ursa\, and a s
 uspicious Klingon named Non capture his parents. Raised by a Christian mi
 ssionary and gifted with superhuman powers\, Robin must save the world\, 
 rescue his family\, romance the mysterious jungle woman Sheila\, and some
 how squeeze several musical numbers into the middle of an interplanetary 
 crisis. Featuring Video Toaster flying effects\, delightfully deranged co
 smic villains\, and enough copyright violations to make a lawyer spontane
 ously combust\, Banglar Superman is a bona fide cult-cinema treasure not 
 to be missed.\n\n\nBangal Superman has been captioned exclusively by Kill
 er B Cinema. You won’t see another version of it elsewhere!\n\n\n\nBangal
  Superman stars Danny Sidak\, Nuton\, Nasir Khan\, and is directed by Ift
 ekhar Jahan.\n\n\nInfo about See-Scape:\n\nOur movies will be shown on th
 e second floor! There are two bars available in See-Scape. The bar on the
  second floor is open during our event and is cash-only. Debit/Credit pur
 chases are available on the main floor.\n\n\nSee-Scape also has an amazin
 g menu. To learn more about See-Scape\, please click here! https://www.se
 escapeto.com/ https://www.seescapeto.com/\n\n\nSee-Scape is located at 34
 7 Keele Street (the closest intersection is Keele/Dundas) and is easily a
 ccessible via TTC. (from Keele Station or Dundas West Station)\n\n\nParki
 ng: There is a Green P parking lot beside See-Scape and a few other paid 
 parking lots nearby.\n\n\nEach month\, join Lizzie Violet & Zoltan Du Lac
  for killer B-moves from the 1930s to the present!\n\n\nPlease like our F
 acebook page and Instagram @killerbcinema so you don’t miss an invite.\n\
 n\nThank you to See-Scape and their staff! They make our monthly event ex
 tra unforgettable!\n\n\nWe hope to see you at See-Scape.\n\n
CATEGORIES:Film,See-Scape
