SUMMARY: Toronto Film School’s Summer Acting Academy for Teens!
DESCRIPTION:Toronto Film School’s Summer Acting Academy for Teens!\n\n  *
  August 10 to 14 from 9 a.m. to 3 p.m.\n  * $650\n\nIn this immersive TFS
  Summer Academy https://•%09https:/www.torontofilmschool.ca/academy/actin
 g-academy \, participants work with Toronto Film School instructors to ex
 plore the craft of acting in a supportive\, hands-on environment. You’ll 
 develop foundational skills including character work\, script analysis\, 
 blocking\, stagecraft\, and camera awareness while learning how to be aut
 hentic and truthful in a role.\n\nGuided by experienced industry professi
 onals\, you’ll prepare scenes for both live performance and industry-stan
 dard self-tapes\, building confidence\, control\, and expressive range. T
 his week-long Acting Academy offers an introductory look at the same prac
 tical\, industry-focused training delivered in Toronto Film School’s full
 -time Acting for Film\, TV and Theatre Diploma Program https://www.toront
 ofilmschool.ca/programs/acting/ .\n\n***Applicants must be entering Grade
  11 or 12 and be 17 or younger at the academy’s end.
CATEGORIES:Workshop,Acting
